; Repository artifact only: this zone fragment is NOT published by Next.js.
; Public DNS is currently delegated to ns1/ns2.natrohost.com, but the record
; below is still only a proposed Natro zone entry until it is added there.
; Review the endpoint and DNSSEC steps in dns/README.md before publishing.

$ORIGIN brainfit.com.tr.

; DNS-AID discovery for the site's HTTPS service. In the Natro DNS panel,
; use the full name _index._agents.karsiyaka.brainfit.com.tr. (or the
; equivalent relative name _index._agents.karsiyaka when editing the
; brainfit.com.tr. zone).
_index._agents.karsiyaka 3600 IN HTTPS 1 karsiyaka.brainfit.com.tr. alpn="h2" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port

; Do not add _a2a._agents.karsiyaka until a real A2A endpoint is deployed.
; It is intentionally absent: this repository currently exposes web/API
; discovery resources, not an A2A protocol endpoint.
